{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":299464,\"title\":\"The Smoke\",\"tagline\":\"How much could you take?\",\"overview\":\"City lawyer Brad Walker is having the worst day of his life. His high-maintenance girlfriend Sasha has left him for his so-called friend Tom and to add insult to injury, he's been fired too. On a night out drowning his sorrows with old friend Dean, he overhears a conversation between Phil and Ben - two drug dealers working for small-time gangster Jack - that will change his life forever...\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2WZryeJnmT8pBCnAVXeykvj8wBz.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":3.8,\"voteCount\":15,\"year\":2014,\"runtime\":89,\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Crime\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Ben Pickering\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1378660,\"name\":\"Ben Pickering\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aqR4Blrglmo4x0FhxmWrRD04aC8.jpg\"},{\"id\":1220246,\"name\":\"Matt Di Angelo\",\"character\":\"Brad\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iOMTShA4ilgA2sJ1ibluWKOUjxG.jpg\"},{\"id\":543845,\"name\":\"Lili Bordán\",\"character\":\"Jodie\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/neylG7XGQuZpIPouQNOyI3YsQTk.jpg\"},{\"id\":1326945,\"name\":\"Kumud Pant\",\"character\":\"Man at bar\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6qYgWw2lI6SnzpMk6Nt7loaH7yy.jpg\"},{\"id\":994,\"name\":\"Stephen Marcus\",\"character\":\"Ben\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oQ6iNYr3KjiHWZYACtX7dao0C37.jpg\"},{\"id\":1378658,\"name\":\"Darren Ripley\",\"character\":\"Phil\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9mIRFnPxglc6oa2JiaoRsr5IgLw.jpg\"},{\"id\":34515,\"name\":\"Velibor Topic\",\"character\":\"Dmitri\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A1bzG46kIEpNlZBLqv5jum5s7xj.jpg\"},{\"id\":118037,\"name\":\"Christian Brassington\",\"character\":\"Tom\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9uRJx2oYlCKuPrbqc9htOPZRqzu.jpg\"},{\"id\":1378659,\"name\":\"Anna Passey\",\"character\":\"Sasha\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/97C6VA6eqr0JyxVuBnq7kU5lpoH.jpg\"},{\"id\":1227688,\"name\":\"Ricky Groves\",\"character\":\"Sweeney\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5OclXETnVfJhW8qoU0e0GZja3At.jpg\"},{\"id\":1194742,\"name\":\"Frazer Hines\",\"character\":\"Mr. Hemmings\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/l3uSOGysJxj57CvYN8C4kS1uDbL.jpg\"},{\"id\":1783074,\"name\":\"Lindsay Armaou\",\"character\":\"Georgina\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/m65r2jEJ9vuLYGwYuOgjbRpPEUf.jpg\"},{\"id\":1102404,\"name\":\"Lucy Clements\",\"character\":\"Mika\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1199390,\"name\":\"Paul Blackwell\",\"character\":\"Police Officer\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xyP9deDatxEMpXS8uNocWuYvLrq.jpg\"},{\"id\":37054,\"name\":\"Alice Bird\",\"character\":\"Jennifer\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":509467,\"title\":\"The Vanished\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lTo5AEHuZwTjrn9Sk5quioEP7FS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z3OgVzd06puEx9KD68T5zzFTrdt.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A detective investigates the disappearance of a woman's corpse from a morgue and tries to uncover the cause of her death.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Crime\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":891621,\"title\":\"Wild Horse Nine\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dNJFRtVg3xLQ7dbNIQ55cmmIniD.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3uLA0ujne91bkzFStZICCYeqhnt.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Shortly before the 1973 Chilean coup, CIA agents Chris and Lee are dispatched from Santiago to Easter Island by their bureau chief, MJ. Amongst the Island's iconic statues, and as the longtime partners wrestle with their dark pasts and present conspiracies, Chris's newfound bond with a pair of rebellious students threatens to send everyone’s trip to this remote paradise sideways.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":432836,\"title\":\"Memoir of a Murderer\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eTdvO9AwJrxq02iYf4Lu5qA0fNc.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/axRYPjeLD4zjJNaIw4TPopbKVfs.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A former serial killer with Alzheimer's fights to protect his daughter from her mysterious boyfriend who may be a serial killer too.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":155,\"title\":\"The Dark Knight\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qJ2tW6WMUDux911r6m7haRef0WH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cfT29Im5VDvjE0RpyKOSdCKZal7.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Batman raises the stakes in his war on crime. With the help of Lt. Jim Gordon and District Attorney Harvey Dent, Batman sets out to dismantle the remaining criminal organizations that plague the streets. The partnership proves to be effective, but they soon find themselves prey to a reign of chaos unleashed by a rising criminal mastermind known to the terrified citizens of Gotham as the Joker.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1419406,\"title\":\"The Shadow's Edge\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cHKo3m8N1fwvEy2ZEr0xGmmMODV.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4BtL2vvEufDXDP4u6xQjjQ1Y2aT.jpg\",\"rating\":8.4,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Macau Police brings the tracking expert police officer out of retirement to help catch a dangerous group of professional thieves.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1375441,\"title\":\"Primetime\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lmrulvLbmaejTix1YaMxo1oGhH1.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sEsMwSDUWGIx9EfNxzM6KzVSsSQ.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 2006, To Catch a Predator host Chris Hansen sets out to make television history. When a high stakes operation goes fatally wrong, his veneered dream of fame curdles into a nightmare of performative justice.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1571955,\"title\":\"Collision Course\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/s2eAK0uiODjlNUSIiOBwdp3at2u.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uI3kWI7kGW5E0F8WduewgQYPt34.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Spain, 2013. After robbing a bank, a getaway crash reveals the hidden side of each thief, exposing betrayals and lies that began long before the heist.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":414906,\"title\":\"The Batman\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/74xTEgt7R36Fpooo50r9T25onhq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rvtdN5XkWAfGX6xDuPL6yYS2seK.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In his second year of fighting crime, Batman uncovers corruption in Gotham City that connects to his own family while facing a serial killer known as the Riddler.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1290821,\"title\":\"Shelter\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cv7DeQQ7TOozPoTCBdNJIvWKhU1.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nHxWyy18SvAZ8jJeemtS8k1UNjM.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A man living in self-imposed exile on a remote island rescues a young girl from a violent storm, setting off a chain of events that forces him out of seclusion to protect her from enemies tied to his past.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1236045,\"title\":\"Animals\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iISM36voS1E8gX9BM0DVK0kgi3E.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5yzM78Tp8nYwSCQtyRcmnHmCn5C.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When the son of an L.A. mayoral candidate is kidnapped, he and his wife have a few hours to come up with the ransom payment. With most of their money spent on his political campaign, they have to get their hands dirty and expose a side of their lives they never intended to see the light of day.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1280738,\"title\":\"The Furious\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ivQ1Z3lI1xWvAeGDHBw3CCYZDGJ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1AVF2fAevpfi2HP6AEpptG1kg8R.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Wang Wei's daughter is abducted by a criminal organization and law enforcement declines to intervene due to corruption, Wei embarks on a solo mission to find her. His sole ally is Navin, a determined journalist whose wife has also mysteriously disappeared. Together, this improbable pair confronts the kidnappers in a fierce martial arts confrontation, driven by an intense desire for retribution.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":475557,\"title\":\"Joker\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/udDclJoHjfjb8Ekgsd4FDteOkCU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rlay2M5QYvi6igbGcFjq8jxeusY.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During the 1980s, a failed stand-up comedian is driven insane and turns to a life of crime and chaos in Gotham City while becoming an infamous psychopathic crime figure.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Thriller\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"N3Ay9KrVhGQ\",\"name\":\"The Smoke Official Trailer (2014)\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}